Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:04.19,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:06.40,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,I sure did! You mean the E-Rank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.56,Default,Nurse C,0,0,0,,Doesn't he have the hottest body?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:13.62,Default,Nurse D,0,0,0,,His face is kind of average, \Nmaybe leaning toward cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:18.92,Default,Nurse E,0,0,0,,He's not that huge, but when you see \Nunder his clothes, it's like, "Whoa!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.98,Default,Nurse F,0,0,0,,When did we get a patient like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:22.54,Default,Nurse F,0,0,0,,I didn't see him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.89,Default,Nurse G,0,0,0,,He didn't stand out at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:31.48,Default,Nurse G,0,0,0,,but he's apparently been exercising \Nand has gotten pretty cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:34.97,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Seriously? There's no way \Nit happened that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.34,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.16,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Mr. Sung Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.74,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,No! Pardon me, actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:51.53,DefaultItalics,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Those really are some incredible muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:57.34,DefaultItalics,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Did he always have such an amazing body?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Did you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:01.42,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.81,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,You're going to be discharged today. \NHow are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Pretty good, thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:08.31,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:11.89,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Well, come by reception when you're ready, \Nand we'll handle the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:13.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right. Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:17.32,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.43,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Could I get your contact info?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You want... my contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:26.61,Default,Nurse H,0,0,0,,Yes. If you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:30.28,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess it's to send me test results \Nafter I get released?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.09,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.38,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,I'm here with our special guest...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.67,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Baek Yoonho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:21.17,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Hunter Baek, you must keep busy as one of \Nthe only seven S-Rank hunters in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:25.81,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,What's a hunter's life like when \Nthey're not exploring dungeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.70,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,That's a good question. \NThere's a lot of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.77,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,You need to hone your skills, \Neach and every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:35.51,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,If you were to lose touch with the feel \Nof real combat, it could dull your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.60,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Every day, then? That must be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:44.87,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,In my case, I made a habit of training \Nback when I was a firefighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:48.96,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,If I make even the slightest mistake, \Nmy comrades could get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:51.54,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,The thought of that keeps me on my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.80,DefaultItalics,Associate,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:56.07,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.35,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,'Morning, Jinah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.43,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You're already up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:07.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've been up. Be careful \Non the way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:12.02,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,There's some leftovers from \Nlast night in the fridge... so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:15.36,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Have you been working out, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.18,Default,SUng Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:21.78,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,And you seem taller. \NDid the exercise help with that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:25.86,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I guess men keep growing \Neven when they're adults!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.59,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:35.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hey. Don't forget an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.72,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,It's nice out today. Plus, it'd be heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How's this little thing heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:41.65,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Aw, come on. Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Better safe than sorry. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:47.49,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay. I'm going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can do my running later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:58.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are these muscles from my stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:03.05,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe if I keep leveling up, \NI'll end up like a bodybuilder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:08.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I still haven't used my points from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Where should I assign these...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:16.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Strength increases the damage I do. \NBut if I can't land a hit, it's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So maybe agility?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:20.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll increase strength and agility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:24.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Vitality always helps, \Nand perception comes in pretty handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:27.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Intellect... seems like it'd have \Nsomething to do with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Do I really need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,H-Hello! This is Sung Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:40.85,DefaultItalics,Landlord,0,0,0,,You finally picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I've actually \Nbeen in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I know that this is about the rent, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:49.04,DefaultItalics,Landlord,0,0,0,,Right. You hadn't paid for this month yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.33,DefaultItalics,Landlord,0,0,0,,But if you need, we can put it off for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,N-No! I'll get it to you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:57.94,DefaultItalics,Landlord,0,0,0,,I see. Well, I'll be waiting. \NYou be careful, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:00.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:06.01,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't know if what I'm experiencing \Nis a re-awakening...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:10.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But now that I'm able \Nto kill goblins with ease,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,making rent shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:18.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That said... It's not exactly easy, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:22.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,To make good money, I need to \Ngo through higher-ranked gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:27.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But no one's gonna let an \NE-Rank hunter into those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe I could get re-appraised?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A higher rank could get me into better gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:36.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and maybe a bit of attention \Nwill help me earn more...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:41.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd definitely stand out, though. \NRe-awakenings are rare enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:46.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a hunter who could \Nlevel up and keep getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:49.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Which would probably mean \Neven more scrutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:54.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The press would eat it up... and there's \Nthe saying about the nail that sticks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I better not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:02.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not until I can properly defend myself \Nand learn what the deal is with this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:16.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.53,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:23.92,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm Hwang Dongsuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.35,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You're E-Rank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:26.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:30.68,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,Oh, I know this guy! He's actually famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:34.82,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,I think his nickname is \N"The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:37.39,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.86,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Okay, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:40.12,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Sorry about my people back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:43.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I am actually E-Rank, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Will that be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:49.11,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Not at all. We need you to meet \Nthe quota more than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:52.51,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I told you over the phone, \Nbut just to confirm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:56.64,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,This is going to be a C-Rank dungeon,\Nand we need a minimum of eight people to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.58,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Among which at least half of the \Nmembers need to be C-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.97,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You won't be a combatant, so we won't \Nbe sharing the spoils with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:07.81,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,But we're prepared to pay you \N2,000,000 for participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.97,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Four C-Ranks and two sub-D-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Understood. What do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:18.44,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,If you could help with our baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:21.83,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,It's food to eat on the inside, \Nalong with spare clothing and gear...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.40,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,and a first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:26.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait... Are you doing this without a healer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:31.66,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know it's hard for \Nindependent parties to retain those.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.55,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We do all our raids without a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:40.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A squad with nothing but tanks \Nand damage dealers... Seems crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And something about \Nthe lack of a healer bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.96,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,If you could just sign the contract...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:53.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No liability for anything that happens \Ninside of the dungeon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:55.43,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:00.85,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It looks like we're here for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.43,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm Yoo Jinho. Twenty-one years old, D-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.55,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm here to meet the quota, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:12.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A D-Rank with gear like that? \NThis kid's family must be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.99,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Is this your first time in a C-Rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:18.00,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It's okay! I'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.00,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Let's be on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:27.19,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Those bags look heavy. \NAre you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:33.51,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm younger, so don't worry \Nabout being polite or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:39.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Did you hear about the president \Nof the firm who was handling this site?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:43.08,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He fled overseas two months ago \Nwith 900 billion he embezzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.94,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The workers and investors were aghast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.01,0:09:50.24,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh, was I rambling without \Nreading the mood again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.72,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I've never been great at social cues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:57.58,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:10:00.99,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Damn! Get a load of the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:03.54,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Gates this big are pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:07.40,Default,Jinsukj,0,0,0,,Mr. Dongsuk, is this really a C-Rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:08.81,Default,Jinsukj,0,0,0,,Seems kinda... big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:14.01,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,The Association folks checked twice, \Nand they say it's C-Rank. No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:18.19,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That really is a huge gate. \NAre we going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:20.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The size of the gate \Ndoesn't matter that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:23.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The level of magic power coming \Nfrom within is the real indicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:27.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's what the Association \Nmeasures to assign a rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:32.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Anything dangerous, like B-Rank or higher, \Nis handled by larger guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,C-Rank ones and below shouldn't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.53,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You really know a lot, Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've been a hunter for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:43.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That said... I've never tackled \Na C-Rank dungeon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.38,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Everyone, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:47.68,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.63,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.04,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan, we need some light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.18,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:07.41,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,What is this place? \NThere're no magic beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.27,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,No light, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:12.28,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Most dungeons are covered in glow stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:13.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A pitch-black dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the Cartenon Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.72,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, what are glow stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:27.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're rocks you tend to see in cave-like \Ndungeons that give off a faint light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:32.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They cover the walls and floor, \Nlighting up the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:36.88,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,So there are essence stones that \Nyou recover from magic beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.70,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,mana stones that you can mine from dungeons,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:43.35,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,and glow stones that light up caves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:45.47,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Seems easy to mix them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:47.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:53.66,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,There really doesn't seem to be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:57.03,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, are there dungeons \Nwithout magic beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:01.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:05.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're here. They just haven't \Nshown themselves yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:05.87,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:06.83,Default,Party,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:11.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What creature lurks in large numbers \Nin the darkness and is attracted to light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're insect-type beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:15.55,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Insects?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.46,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Damn it! Insect-types?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:19.24,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Mr. Dongsuk, do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.84,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,No! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.38,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Damn it, is this an ant nest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:23.93,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,That'd be really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.52,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,The noise is getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.98,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,Where are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.74,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,There're too many tunnels!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:30.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:35.82,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.74,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'll draw their attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:40.62,Default,Party,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:43.16,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Stay close to me, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.77,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Come and get me, vermin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.21,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wow... All of the bugs are \Nheaded toward Mr. Hwang!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:56.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A taunt skill? No wonder he's C-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:13:00.45,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Jinsuk! Eleven o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:01.26,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Copy that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:02.84,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I should help—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.00,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Stay back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:04.93,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Mind the countdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:08.52,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Five... Four... Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:10.02,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Two... One...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.06,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.45,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Here comes a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:14.27,Default,Cho Kyuhnwan,0,0,0,,Chew on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.69,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Good! Now, let's wrap this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.03,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.35,0:13:20.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're well coordinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:23.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's easy to see that they've been \Nworking together for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:28.91,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still, it might be the lack of a healer, \Nbut they're a bit rough around the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:34.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,As for Jinho... Looks like his gear \Nis making up for any lack of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're doing a fine enough job, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:47.59,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:49.60,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.89,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Was that the last one? Jinsuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:56.36,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. No survivors. We're all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.20,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Good! All clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.86,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We grab the essence stones \Nand split them seven ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.53,Default,Party,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.51,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,This is my favorite part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:06.49,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:09.13,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You really helped out earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:11.56,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,If we had noticed them even a moment later...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:12.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.17,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,How'd you know they were coming from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:20.21,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Well, those are sharp instincts \Nyou've got. They saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.86,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Mr. Dongsuk! Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.80,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,The wounds on these ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.06,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That's not from a sword strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:30.34,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, too. \NAnd they're not burns from magic, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:35.30,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,There's more than a few that \Nlook like they were torn to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.31,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Maybe there was a turf battle \Nwith some other magic beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:42.89,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,That'd imply there's something stronger \Nthan these things around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.85,0:14:47.92,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Something big enough to prey on these bugs...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:53.23,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Did you see me get that beast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:54.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:58.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinho. That sword and shield \Nprobably cost a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:03.63,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Since this is my first raid, \Nmy father got me something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:07.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I see. Well, I'm not exactly sure why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:09.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but we should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.55,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?! A bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:23.90,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Calm down. That's something \Nyou hear all the time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.91,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,It's just the Guildmaster doing his training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:38.25,Default,Go Myungwan,0,0,0,,Damn... He blew through \Nthat huge stone with one hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:42.55,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,That didn't even amount to a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.62,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hey! Could someone clean up in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.14,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,This is a long path...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The size of a dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.97,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,...has nothing to do with its rank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:56.52,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You mentioned its magic power rating before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:16:00.70,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Does that mean this dungeon \Nis huge but mostly empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:05.64,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It must be hard lugging all that stuff \Naround such a big dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.90,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:10.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.09,0:16:14.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And getting paid without having \Nto fight is a pretty good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:19.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A pretty good deal... Maybe too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Something keeps bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:27.92,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're a battle-tested party... \Nwithout a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One that needed extra members \Nto fill the quota...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.81,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Another half-dead one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.33,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.41,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:38.63,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,This is a bit weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:42.56,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We've covered a ton of distance, \Nand we haven't seen a single healthy beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:45.85,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,Just ones that are injured or already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.79,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,The boss has gotta be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:50.03,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Well, obviously, or a gate \Nwouldn't have opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.76,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.03,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan, give us some light up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:54.83,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:02.39,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the boss chamber down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:03.21,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:16.90,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:18.18,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.77,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,Mana crystals!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.02,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,Damn, just look at them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.18,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,They might not be worth \Nas much as essence stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:27.90,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,but a haul like this? Even at a glance, \Nthere's probably a billion's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:32.12,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Y'know, Mr. Dongsuk, even your brother \Nwould be jealous of a score like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:36.17,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't bring up his brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.44,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Dongsoo... It's like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.77,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You don't always get to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:46.34,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,And you'd better not think I'm always gonna \Nshow deference to you, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:51.05,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm gonna use this haul \Nto grow my strike team!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:52.87,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,We really hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:55.33,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,If we split this seven ways, \Nit's gonna be over 100 million each.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:56.73,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,How are we gonna carry it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:59.99,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, can I see the contract you signed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.99,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good with legal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:03.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:06.23,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can I ask something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.82,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,This is Jinwoo's contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:12.45,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It only specifies that he doesn't \Nget a share of the battle drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:16.41,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Since mana crystals are excavated \Nand not dropped by beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:19.93,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,shouldn't this be split eight ways \Ninstead of seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:21.41,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:24.51,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Let's split it evenly. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:28.63,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Still, we'll need to deal with that first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.57,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The dungeon boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:34.34,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm sure you realize this, but once the boss \Nis defeated, the gate will close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:39.40,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We'll need to mine and haul the mana \Ncrystals out before fighting that spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:45.24,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Luckily, it seems to be asleep, which gives \Nus the perfect chance to start excavating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.65,0:18:47.33,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Chul-jin, where's the gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:52.16,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,I mean... I didn't expect there \Nto be this many mana crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:55.21,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,I left the transport stuff back with my ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:58.12,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Damn it, don't I tell you to always bring it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.82,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:03.87,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but could you two \Nkeep an eye on things here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:05.64,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We need to collect some equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:09.21,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But this is the boss chamber! \NAnd it'll be just me and Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:13.57,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It seems to be asleep, \Nprobably on a full stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:16.76,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I doubt it'll wake up \Nunless something bothers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:17.77,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:20.60,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,This is your first raid, right, Yoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:24.23,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,And this is Sung's first C-Rank dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.29,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Just trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:28.12,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:30.65,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I need to discuss some stuff \Nwith my team, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.84,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,so we'll take a break while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:37.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The regulations say you need eight members \Nto tackle a C-Rank dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:41.63,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Minus Jinho and I, there are \Nsix people in the strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.62,FlashbackItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We do all our raids without a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:47.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He said "all our raids,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,which means they've tackled \NC-Rank dungeons before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:54.77,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So wouldn't they have regulars who \Nthey'd call up to meet the quota?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:20:00.01,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan... seal off the boss chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.85,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The entrance! But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:10.77,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Does this mean... they betrayed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:13.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I knew it. Those bastards...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:17.24,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You run into some real crooks \Nin this line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:21.52,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Since it's dangerous,\Naccidents happen regularly enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:24.78,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,But since those accidents \Nare totally isolated,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:29.21,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,you could also commit a crime, \Nand it'd never come to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.63,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,There are no security cameras in dungeons,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.71,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,and if there are no living witnesses, \Nthere'll never be any evidence, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:41.21,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sometimes they use weak people as bait \Nfor enemies, or abandon them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:45.14,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,like a lizard leaving its tail behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:50.58,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,They'd try to kill us just \Nfor some mana crystals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.81,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,If... If I hadn't mentioned \Nthe contract, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:00.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,they were ready to kill us \Nafter one wrong move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:06.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.21,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,P-Please get back, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:13.81,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'll manage somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We could get out from there, \Nif we needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:19.13,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's probably what \NHwang's people have in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:29.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A C-Rank boss... and an E-Rank hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:32.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This thing is literally \Non a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:41.28,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A whole different... level...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.91,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinho. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:48.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:51.04,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wait, wh-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:21:59.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll beat it.
